  <metadata><name>Day 2 option 2: Mount Clear loop</name><desc>35.0 km. WARNING: About 6.7 km of the Mount Clear Fire Trail (km 13 to 23) is on the NSW side of the border, outside the national park on private rural land. Check access before riding this option. Route from OpenStreetMap data via BRouter. Elevation data: Geoscience Australia 1 second DEM (CC BY 4.0).</desc></metadata>
